    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 650,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Moviemistakes.com\nMoviemistakes.com is an Internet website created by Jon Sandys in 1996 . Its primary focus is to record mistakes found in film and television projects , with some books and games , and supplementary material covering trivia , quotes , DVD Easter eggs and movie trailers . As of 19 March 2015 the site lists over 110,000 mistakes and 14,000 items of trivia from more than 8,000 titles . The site categorises mistakes into eight different areas : continuity , factual errors , mistakes that reveal the film-making process , visible crew or equipment , plot holes , audio problems , deliberate `` mistakes '' , and character mistakes ."
     }
